    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/": {
      "body": "<p><strong>Join the Thriving PropertyList Community!<br /></strong>Collaborate with fellow agents, access expert resources, and elevate your real estate career. Here, you&#8217;ll find:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Engaging Forums: (coming soon)<br /></strong>Share knowledge, ask questions, and connect with other agents.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Comprehensive Resources:</strong> <strong>(coming soon)</strong><br />Dive into a library of video tutorials, educational materials, and training tools.</li>\n<li><strong>WhatsApp Groups: <br /></strong>As of January 2025, our WhatsApp community boasts 2,978 estate agents who are actively sharing properties and accelerating their earnings like never before! Join the community!</li>\n\n<li><strong>Seamless Collaboration:</strong> Work together to make the real estate process smoother and more professional for everyone.</li>\n</ul>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/video-tutorials/": {
      "body": "<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\r\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"ezd-doc-badge\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAdditional Resources\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Video Tutorials</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"read-time\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"views sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10270\" class=\"elementor elementor-10270\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c949bd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1c949bd\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-80af0a2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"80af0a2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/propertylist-video-tutorials/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click here to see video tutorials</a> &#8211; COMING SOON</h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t    <div class=\"doc-btm\">\r\n                <div class=\"eazydocs-next-prev-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager second\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/mls-support/\">\r\n                    <span> Next - Additional Resources </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tContact MLS Support                </a>\r\n\t\t\t        </div>\r\n\t\t    </div>\r\n    </article>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/ai-ezd_ampersand-automation/ai-property-research-agent/": {
      "body": "<h2>Elevate Your Agency with AI-Driven Property Reports</h2><p>You’re an estate agent—your reputation depends on swift, accurate insights and polished, client-ready reports. Meet our PropertyList AI Research Agent: designed to supercharge your listings, wow your clients and keep you leagues ahead of the competition.</p><h3>Why Top Agents Can’t Do Without It</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Win More Instructions</strong><br />Impress vendors with cutting-edge technology. Deliver hyper-detailed market analyses that demonstrate you know every square metre of their neighbourhood.</p></li><li><p><strong>Delight Buyers</strong><br />Clients crave clear visuals and hard data. Hand them PDFs packed with instant price-per-sq m comparisons, commute maps, Ofsted ratings, and amenity-to-property distances.</p></li><li><p><strong>Streamline Your Day</strong><br />No more wrestling with spreadsheets or Googling “planned developments.” Click once and receive every chart, stat and forecast in under 10 seconds.</p></li></ul><h3>Step-by-Step: From Click to Close</h3><ol><li><p><strong>Spot the “AI Analysis” Button</strong><br />On any PropertyList.es MLS entry, you’ll find the bright “AI Analysis” button alongside your listing.</p></li><li><p><strong>Refine the Scope</strong><br />In the pop-up, add precise details—street name (“Oxford Street”), landmark (“opposite Selfridges”), or local insights (“so close to Hyde Park”). The more exact you are, the sharper the AI’s output.</p></li><li><p><strong>Let AI Do the Heavy Lifting</strong><br />Hit “Analyse.” Immediately you’ll see:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Comparative Market Report:</strong> Your property versus the top 12 comparable &#8211; price trends, average days on market, value-drivers</p></li><li><p><strong>Local Deep-Dive:</strong> School performance, crime figures, green-space proximities, and even café-to-tube station distances</p></li><li><p><strong>Future Developments:</strong> Planned builds, zoning changes, new Crossrail or Cycle Superhighway links—keep well ahead of market shifts</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Customise &amp; Share</strong><br />Choose your report style &#8211; Vendor Proposal, Buyer Guide, Investor Brief or Tenant Pack -and download as:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Mobile-optimised</strong> PDF for viewings on the move</p></li><li><p><strong>Printable layout</strong> PDF for open-house or more personal handouts</p></li></ul></li></ol><h3>Agent Pro Tips</h3><ul><li><strong>Tweak Before Sending:</strong> Give the AI’s copy a quick once-over—add your agency’s tone or branding touches.</li><li><strong>Flip the Focus:</strong> Switch between “Vendor Report” (emphasising ROI and price-per-sq m) and “Buyer Report” (highlighting lifestyle and amenities).</li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Stay Ahead. Impress Clients. Close Quicker.</strong><br />Log in to PropertyList.es, click “AI Analysis” on any listing, and let our AI Property Research Agent give your agency the unrivalled edge &#8211; one report at a time.</p><p>Not a member yet?? You can join for FREE!!<br />PropertyList.es</p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/credits/": {
      "body": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><h3 data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:65\">Understanding PropertyList Credits:</h3><p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:173\">Sharing properties is FREE but that&#8217;s not all <a href=\"http://PropertyList.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a> is. <br />PropertyList uses a credit system to unlock various extra features like featuring your listings, CRM and options designed to maximise your listing&#8217;s exposure and generate leads.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:23\"><strong>Purchasing Credits:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"7:1-8:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"7:1-8:0\"><strong>Top Up Your Account:</strong> You can easily purchase credits directly through the &#8220;Credits&#8221; tab or by clicking any extra features within your account.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"7:1-8:0\">Follow the prompts to purchase credits. You’ll need to provide payment information. PropertyList.es is secured by <a href=\"https://www.cloudflare.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cloudflare</a>, review <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/security/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList Site Safety &amp; Security here</a>.</li><li>Once the transaction is complete, your new credits will be added to your account.</li><li><strong>Credits do not expire.</strong></li></ul><h3>How it works?</h3><p>Buy credits (1 Credit = €1)  ➡  Use them when you want for <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/pricing/#features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">extra features</a></p><p>No monthly fees.</p><p>Pay for what you want, when you want.</p><h3 data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:18\">What Credits do for you?</h3><p data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:106\">Credits empower you to leverage a variety of features across three main categories: MLS, CRM and Property Portal.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:47\"><strong>1. Enhance Your MLS Presence:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"15:1-18:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:134\"><strong>Feature on MLS:</strong> Increase your exposure by featuring your listing prominently infront of other properties on the MLS platform. This ensures maximum visibility to a vast network of agents actively searching for new listings. Featured properties receive significantly more views than regular listings, ensuring your property remains top of mind for fellow agents.</li></ul><p><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\"><b>2. Supercharge Your Public Portal Listings: COMING SOON</b></span></p><ul><li data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:144\"><strong>Feature on Public Property Portal<strong style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\"> (coming Soon)</strong>:</strong> Showcase your property prominently by featuring it within the Public Property Portal, attracting local and global buyers and renters. </li><li data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:144\"><strong>Open Up Direct Leads<strong style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\"> (coming Soon)</strong>:</strong> PropertyList.es&#8217; Public Property Portal acts as your gateway to a <strong>local &amp; global audience</strong> of potential buyers and renters actively searching for properties on its platform. By leveraging their extensive reach, you can tap into a vast pool of motivated individuals ready to make a move, both locally and internationally. With prominent placement and targeted tools, you can generate a pipeline of direct leads eager to explore your listing.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:317\">and much more coming soon!</li></ul><p><strong>In essence,</strong> credits allow you to unlock powerful tools to customise your PropertyList.es experience.</p><p><a style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/pricing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See All Features &amp; Pricing</a></p><p>PropertyList.es offers estate agents essential tools to sell or rent properties for free. For additional advantages, explore our paid features: expand your reach with MLS exposure and attract targeted leads through the Property Portal. With credits, you can maximise your listing&#8217;s potential and connect directly with qualified leads actively seeking properties like yours.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:114\"><a href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Not signed up yet? Get a FREE account and connect with agents throughout Andalucía. Streamline collaboration and close more deals.</a></p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/documents/": {
      "body": "<p>In this area, you can upload, organise, and link documents associated with your saved contacts or properties. Whether it’s contracts, floor plans, or important correspondence, having everything neatly stored in one place will make your life easier. No more frantic searches through cluttered folders—just a few clicks away!</p><p> </p>"
    },
