    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/getting-started/": {
      "body": "<h3><strong>What is PropertyList?</strong></h3><p><strong>PropertyList</strong> is a comprehensive real estate platform that offers free listings, users, branded microsites, CRM and other tools to efficiently list, manage, and market properties, with additional paid features available for enhanced functionalities. Pay as you go with no monthly subscriptions.</p><p>This manual provides detailed instructions and information on all aspects of the platform, from <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/import-properties/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">importing your properties</a> to <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/pipeline-tracking/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">managing sales pipeline</a>,<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.15px; text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color);\"> a comprehensive guide to using the PropertyList MLS platform.</span></p><p><strong>Who should use this manual?</strong></p><p>This manual is intended for all users of the PropertyList MLS platform. Whether you are a new user or an experienced user, you will find helpful information in this manual. We&#8217;re always working on new features to help estate agents close more deals and save time. Keep an eye out for upcoming updates and features!</p><p><strong>What is included in this manual?</strong></p><p>This manual includes the following information:</p><ul><li><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/creating-a-new-listing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Creating and managing listings</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-advanced-user-manual/how-to-manage-your-leads/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Managing leads</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/pipeline-tracking/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Using the Client Pipeline</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-advanced-user-manual/how-to-use-the-calendar/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Using the PropertyList Calendar</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/property-portal-manual/reports-and-statistics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Generating reports and statistics</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/forums/forum/employment-opportunities/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Posting Job Opportunities</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/\"><strong>Additional resources</strong></a></li></ul><p><strong>How to use this manual</strong></p><p>This manual is organised into a series of chapters and sections, you can find sections on the left of all document pages. Each chapter covers a different topic, and each section provides detailed instructions on a specific task. You can use the search function to find the exact information you need.</p><p>We hope you find this manual helpful. If you have any questions, please contact <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/mls-support/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList support</a>.</p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/getting-started/download-app/": {
      "body": "<p><strong>Desktop App:</strong></p><ol><li>Open your <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=chrome+download&amp;oq=chrome+download&amp;gs_lcrp=EgZjaHJvbWUyCQgAEEUYORiABDIHCAEQABiABDIHCAIQABiABDIHCAMQABiABDIHCAQQABiABDIHCAUQABiABDIHCAYQABiABDIHCAcQABiABDIHCAgQABiABDIHCAkQABiABNIBCDI2MzdqMGo3qAIAsAIA&amp;sourceid=chrome&amp;ie=UTF-8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">chrome web browser</a> and login to <a href=\"https://agents.propertylist.es./\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://agents.propertylist.es.</a></li><li>Click the 3 dots in the top right corner.</li><li>Look for &#8220;Cast, save and share and click it.</li><li>Select &#8220;Install page as app&#8230;&#8221;</li><li>Name your app (e.g. PropertyList) and tap &#8220;Install&#8221;</li><li>Pin the app to you taskbar. Select &#8220;Yes&#8221;</li></ol><p></p><p><strong>Android App: </strong></p><ol><li>Open your <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=chrome+download&amp;oq=chrome+download&amp;gs_lcrp=EgZjaHJvbWUyCQgAEEUYORiABDIHCAEQABiABDIHCAIQABiABDIHCAMQABiABDIHCAQQABiABDIHCAUQABiABDIHCAYQABiABDIHCAcQABiABDIHCAgQABiABDIHCAkQABiABNIBCDI2MzdqMGo3qAIAsAIA&amp;sourceid=chrome&amp;ie=UTF-8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">chrome web browser</a>  and login to <a href=\"https://agents.propertylist.es./\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://agents.propertylist.es.</a></li><li>Tap the 3 dots menu at the top right corner.</li><li>Select &#8220;Add to Home screen.&#8221; and Click &#8220;Install&#8221;.</li><li>Name the shortcut (e.g., &#8220;PropertyList&#8221;) and tap &#8220;Add.&#8221;</li><li>Confirm the addition by tapping &#8220;Add&#8221; again, and the shortcut or app will appear on your home screen.</li></ol><p><strong>iPhone (iOS) Shortcut:</strong></p><ol><li>Open Safari and login to <a href=\"https://agents.propertylist.es./\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://agents.propertylist.es.</a></li><li>Tap the Share icon (the square with an arrow pointing up).</li><li>Scroll down and select &#8220;Add to Home Screen.&#8221;</li><li>Name the shortcut (e.g., &#8220;PropertyList &#8220;) and tap &#8220;Add.&#8221;</li><li>The shortcut will appear on your home screen.</li></ol>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/": {
      "body": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:181\">Listing your property on PropertyList MLS is a breeze, and you can do it from anywhere – even your mobile! Our tech team is constantly innovating to make the platform even smoother and more effective.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:52\"><span style=\"color: var(--p_color);\">While PropertyList MLS offers the convenience of uploading your properties via an XML feed, we recommend adding them directly to the system for maximum control. This method gives you more flexibility to tailor each listing&#8217;s details and ensure accuracy.</span></p><p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:23\"><strong>Two Upload Options:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"9:1-11:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:355\"><strong style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">XML Feed:</strong><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\"> Upload your existing properties quickly and efficiently with an XML feed. This is a great time-saver if you have a large number of listings to add </span><strong style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">but be aware, it will overwrite any properties you&#8217;ve already added directly to the system</strong><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">.<br /></span>For this reason, we recommend using the XML feed first to get your initial properties uploaded. Then, as you acquire new listings, you can simply add them directly to PropertyList MLS for maximum control. &#8211; <a style=\"letter-spacing: 0.15px; text-align: var(--text-align);\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/export-listings-xml/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">XML Export Feeds Provided.</a></li></ul><ul data-sourcepos=\"9:1-11:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:355\"><strong>Manual upload (Recommended):</strong> Take full control of your listings by adding them directly to PropertyList MLS. This method allows you to carefully craft descriptions, select the most relevant features, and ensure all information is accurate before publishing. </li></ul><p data-sourcepos=\"12:1-12:128\"><strong>Whichever method you choose, be sure to review our guide on the differences between the two in the sections below before uploading.</strong></p><p data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:47\"><strong>Maximise Visibility with Detailed Listings:</strong></p><p data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:320\">Regardless of the upload method, providing comprehensive details and selecting all applicable features is crucial! Property hunters often filter searches based on specific features. For example, if your listing boasts an indoor pool, selecting that feature guarantees it gets shown to those seeking exactly that amenity.</p><p><a href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">List Your Property Now!</a></p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/": {
      "body": "<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\r\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"ezd-doc-badge\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMLS User Manual\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Managing Listings</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"read-time\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"views sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9656\" class=\"elementor elementor-9656\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05eec0e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"05eec0e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e4192ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e4192ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Edit your existing listings, change property status and generate reports.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"details_cont ent recently_added\" id=\"content_elements\"><h4 class=\"c_head\">Articles</h4><ul class=\"article_list\"><li class=\"page_item page-item-9658\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/editing-existing-listings/\">Editing existing listings</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-9660\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/changing-property-status/\">Changing property status</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-9654\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/tracking-property-enquiries-leads/\">Tracking property enquiries/leads</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-12019\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/export-listings-xml/\">Export Listings XML</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-9664\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/generating-property-reports/\">Generating property reports</a></li>\n</ul></div>\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t    <div class=\"doc-btm\">\r\n                <div class=\"eazydocs-next-prev-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager first\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/microsite-share-properties-listings/\">\r\n                    <span> MLS User Manual - Previous </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tMicroSite &#8211; Share                </a>\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager second\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/marketing-and-promotion/\">\r\n                    <span> Next - MLS User Manual </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tMarketing and Promotion                </a>\r\n\t\t\t        </div>\r\n\t\t    </div>\r\n    </article>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/tracking-property-enquiries-leads/": {
      "body": "<p><strong>Effortless Lead Generation with PropertyList.es!</strong></p><p>We go the extra mile to ensure your properties reach the right audience, maximising your chances of securing qualified leads. See how below!</p><p><strong>MLS LEADS</strong></p><p>Upload your properties to our MLS portal and instantly tap into a vast network of agencies and agents across Andalucía and much more coming soon. This broadens your reach significantly, attracting a larger pool of qualified clients for your listings.</p><ul><li><strong>Click &#8220;MLS LEADS&#8221; =&gt; Here you can manage all your MLS Leads and assign staff to specific enquiries.</strong></li></ul><p><strong>DIRECT PORTAL LEADS &#8211; COMING SOON</strong></p><p>By listing your properties for free on <a href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a> they will be advertised globally and gain major exposure to find direct buyers or tenants for your listings. Secure qualified leads with <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/credits/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">credits</a> &#8211; a cost-effective way to maximise your chances of a successful sale.</p><p><strong>WINDOW CARD URL LEADS</strong></p><p>Share your properties with unique, personalised URLs. Each listing features a convenient contact form at the bottom, making it simple for potential buyers or tenants to reach out.</p><p>Every new lead automatically populates into your contacts with a notification or will update history for existing contacts, PropertyList smartly updates their information and notifies you of their message. This streamlined process saves you time and ensures you never miss a potential sale.</p><ul><li><strong>Click &#8220;DIRECT LEADS&#8221; =&gt; Here</strong><strong style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\"> you can manage all your Landing Page URL Leads and assign staff to specific enquiries.</strong></li></ul><p><a href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Unlock Maximum Exposure. Sign Up &amp; List Your Properties FREE on PropertyList.es Today!</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://propertylist.es\"></a></p><p><em><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> PropertyList.es strives to provide the most accurate information possible. However, due to the dynamic nature of the real estate industry, features and functionalities may occasionally change.  We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause.</em></p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-your-leads/portal-leads/": {
      "body": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><h3>COMING SOON: Unlock High-Quality Leads with PropertyList</h3><p><strong>Struggling to find qualified leads for your listings? </strong>PropertyList has the solution with Public Portal Leads. Connect with serious buyers and renters actively searching for properties.</p><h4>What are Portal Leads?</h4><p>At PropertyList, we generate valuable leads from buyers and tenants browsing our portal. Our extensive advertising efforts ensure your properties receive maximum exposure, delivering the best direct leads possible.</p><h4>The Pay-Per-Enquiry Advantage</h4><p>With our pay-per-enquiry model, when a lead comes in, you will see the request without contact information. If you decide to purchase the lead using your credits, the contact information will be revealed. This ensures you only connect with motivated individuals, eliminating wasted costs.</p><h4>Meticulously Screened Leads</h4><p>We ensure the leads you receive are relevant and qualified, saving you time on filtering through irrelevant enquiries and allowing you to focus on serious prospects. Additionally, if you receive an &#8220;agent&#8221; lead, your credits will be promptly returned.</p><h4>How to Leverage Portal Leads</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Optimise Your Listings</strong>: Craft compelling headlines, detailed descriptions, and high-quality photos. Use <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/searching-for-properties/filters/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">smart keywords</a> to help property seekers find what they&#8217;re looking for.</p></li><li><p><strong>Respond Promptly</strong>: Quickly respond to enquiries to keep leads engaged. We recommend responding within 48 hours. If the lead is rejected or not opened within 72h, it will be redirected to a duplicate property for the best user experience.</p></li><li><p><strong>Professional Communication</strong>: Be prompt, courteous, and informative in your responses to foster trust.</p></li></ul><h4>Easy Management of Portal Leads</h4><p>All leads are delivered to the dedicated &#8220;PORTAL LEADS&#8221; tab in your account. You can:</p><ul><li><strong>Easily Access and Review Leads</strong>: View all incoming leads in one location.</li><li><strong>Effortless Lead Assignment</strong>: Assign leads to team members for efficient follow-up.</li><li><strong>Automated Contact Creation</strong>: Each lead is converted into a contact, linked with their enquiry for easy management.</li></ul>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/marketing-and-promotion/feature-your-property-on-the-public-property-portal/": {
      "body": "<div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\" dir=\"ltr\"><h3 data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:58\">&#8211; COMING SOON</h3><h2 data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:58\"> </h2><h4 data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:58\">Get Noticed! Global Reach, Local Focus</h4><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:286\">Want to attract potential buyers or renters fast? PropertyList.es Public Portal positions your property front and centre, capturing the attention of a wide audience eager for their next home. Our strategic advertising reaches both local and global markets, ensuring your property gets noticed by the right people, at the right time. Bring you Direct Leads.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:286\"><strong>Unleash Wider Reach:</strong> Unlike traditional marketing methods, featuring on the Public Portal broadens your reach significantly. Get your property seen by a vast pool of potential buyers or renters actively searching on <a href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a>, a platform trusted by countless property hunters.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:220\"><strong>Showcase Your Listing:</strong> High-quality photos and a captivating description are crucial, but featuring takes it a step further. Grab attention and stand out from the crowd with prominent placement on the Public Portal.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:30\"><strong>Simple Steps to Featuring:</strong></p><ul><li><b>coming soon</b></li></ul><p data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:26\"><strong>Benefits of Featuring:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"21:1-24:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:124\"><strong>Increased Public Visibility:</strong> Reach a wider audience of potential buyers or renters actively searching <a href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es.</a></li><li data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:113\"><strong>Enhanced Lead Generation:</strong> Generate more inquiries and interest in your property, leading to faster results.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"23:1-24:0\"><strong>Stand Out from the Crowd:</strong> Gain a competitive edge and attract qualified leads with prominent placement on the Public Portal.</li></ul><p data-sourcepos=\"25:1-25:277\"><strong>Remember:</strong> Featuring is a powerful tool, but it works best alongside a well-crafted listing with high-quality photos, a compelling description, and competitive pricing. Combine these strategies to generate excitement around your property and secure a successful transaction.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"27:1-27:181\"><strong>Bonus Tip:</strong> Maximise your listing&#8217;s reach by leveraging social media. Share properties with your <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/microsite-share-properties-listings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FREE Branded MicroSite</a> to attract more potential buyers or renters.</p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/mls-property-alerts/": {
      "body": "<h3>Never Miss the Perfect Property Again!</h3><p>With the PropertyList “Property Alert” feature, staying on top of new client request has never been easier. Effortlessly save your searches for a contact and receive notifications the moment new properties matching your criteria become available.</p><h4>Here’s what you’ll enjoy:</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Save Time:</strong> Store your search parameters so you won&#8217;t have to re-enter them every time. 1-Click-Search.</p></li><li><p><strong>Stay Updated:</strong></p><div tabindex=\"0\" role=\"article\" data-tabster=\"{&quot;groupper&quot;:{&quot;tabbability&quot;:2},&quot;focusable&quot;:{}}\" data-content=\"ai-message\" aria-labelledby=\"JTM2f5k9bezrp8budzPbt-author} JTM2f5k9bezrp8budzPbt-content-0\"><div id=\"JTM2f5k9bezrp8budzPbt-content-0\"><p>Get instant notifications when properties matching your saved search criteria are listed—in both your contacts and on the property itself. When you view a property, it recommends your saved clients who are potential matches.</p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/mls-user-manual/navigate-the-mls-dashboard-and-interface/": {
      "body": "<div class=\"chat-history-scroll-container ng-tns-c3858428742-2 show-bottom-shadow ng-trigger ng-trigger-resetChat\"><div class=\"conversation-container ng-tns-c3858428742-2 narrow-container ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"ng-tns-c2575049534-122\"><div class=\"response-container ng-tns-c978905454-123 response-container-has-multiple-responses\"><div class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c978905454-123\"><div class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c978905454-123\"><div class=\"response-content ng-trigger ng-trigger-responsePopulation ng-tns-c978905454-123\"><div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\" dir=\"ltr\"><p data-sourcepos=\"50:1-50:187\">The MLS interface is designed to be user-friendly and easy to navigate.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"52:1-52:57\"><strong>Here are a few tips for navigating the MLS interface:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"54:1-58:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"54:1-54:132\">Pay attention to the colours and fonts of the system. This will help you to identify important elements, such as links and buttons.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"55:1-55:119\">Use the mouse pointer to hover over elements to see tooltips. Tooltips provide additional information about elements. </li><li data-sourcepos=\"56:1-56:89\">Use the keyboard to navigate between elements. This can be faster than using the mouse.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"57:1-58:0\">If you are lost, use the help documentation or contact MLS support for assistance.</li></ul><p><a href=\"https://agents.propertylist.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ready to dive in? Head to your MLS dashboard and start exploring!</a></p><p><a href=\"http://propertylist.es\"></a></p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/new-developments/": {
      "body": "<h2 data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"198\">List for Free on PropertyList.es</h2><p><strong>LAUNCH DATE: 25th Augusts 2025</strong></p><p data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"395\">Are you a property developer looking to showcase your new-build projects to a wider audience—at zero cost? PropertyList.es is your opportunity to get direct exposure <strong data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"394\">without any listing fees</strong>.</p><h3 data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"429\">Why List on PropertyList.es?</h3><ul data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"961\"><li data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"561\"><p data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"561\"><strong data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"454\">100% Free to List</strong> – No hidden charges, no subscription plans. Simply upload your developments and start generating interest.</p></li><li><strong>Paid Fetaures</strong> – <strong data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1238\">Highlight Developments</strong> – Make your project stand out with enhanced visibility on the homepage and in newsletters and much more coming soon.</li><li data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"726\"><p data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"726\"><strong data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"591\">Access to Active Agents</strong> – Your properties become instantly searchable and shareable by hundreds of local and international agents working with direct clients.</p></li><li data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"865\"><p data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"865\"><strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"745\">No Middlemen</strong> – Agents can send your properties directly to buyers, boosting visibility and increasing the chances of a quicker sale.</p></li><li data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"961\"><p data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"961\"><strong data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"887\">Easy to Onboard</strong> – We support various data feeds and can help get your listings live fast.</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"992\">Designed to Help You Sell</h3><p data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1203\">Whether you&#8217;re launching a new phase or selling the final units, PropertyList.es is a powerful tool to amplify your reach—at no cost. Add your developments today and let agents help bring you qualified buyers.</p><p data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1275\">👉 <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/new-developments/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1275\">Start listing now. It&#8217;s free, fast, and built to help you sell.</strong></a></p><p data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1275\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/new-developments/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">&#8212; Developers Sign Up Here &#8212;</a></p><p data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1275\"> </p><h2 data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"221\">Free Access for Agents</h2><p data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"428\">Looking for high-quality new-build properties to offer your clients? With PropertyList.es, you get <strong data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"348\">completely free access</strong> to a growing database of new developments from trusted developers across Spain.</p><h3 data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"458\">Why Use PropertyList.es?</h3><ul data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"997\"><li data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"570\"><p data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"570\"><strong data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"477\">Free to Use</strong> – No sign-up fees, no subscriptions. Search, save, and share listings without paying a cent.</p></li><li data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"711\"><p data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"711\"><strong data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"607\">New-Builds from Top Developers</strong> – Gain instant access to the latest developments, including off-plan and under-construction properties.</p></li><li data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"879\"><p data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"879\"><strong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"741\">Ready-to-Share Listings</strong> – Each property is fully detailed and shareable with your direct clients, helping you present opportunities professionally and instantly.</p></li><li data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"997\"><p data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"997\"><strong data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"895\">Save Time</strong> – No need to chase developers or request marketing materials. Everything’s in one place, ready to go.</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1044\">Built for Agents Who Want to Sell Smarter</h3><p data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1216\">Whether you&#8217;re working with investors, relocators, or first-time buyers, PropertyList.es gives you the tools to deliver results—quickly, professionally, and <strong data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1215\">for free</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1313\"><a href=\"https://propertylist.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">👉 <strong data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1313\">Start exploring new developments today and match your clients with the perfect property.</strong></a></p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/new-features-roadmap/": {
      "body": "<p>We are dedicated to providing our members with the latest technology and innovative tools to make searching, sharing, and selling simpler and more efficient.</p><p><strong>If you have suggestions, please explore the <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/request-new-features/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Request New Features page</a> to upvote ideas or add your own if it’s not already listed.</strong></p><p>Below, you&#8217;ll find a Roadmap of our latest and upcoming features and updates:</p><p><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">28th January 2025 </span>✅<em><br /></em></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">MLS Soft Launch Date to Pioneers</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">12th February 2025 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><strong>✅</strong></span><em><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><strong><br /></strong></span></em>MLS Launch Date to WhatsApp Groups with 2,500+ estate agents &amp; Public Release.</p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">1st April 2025</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\">✅</span><br /></strong>New Feature:  Short-Term Rentals Launch</p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">1st June 2025</span></strong><em><br /></em>New Feature: <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/marketing-and-promotion/feature-your-property-on-the-public-property-portal/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Public Portal</a> Launch</p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/reports-and-statistics/": {
      "body": "<div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\" dir=\"ltr\"><h3 data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:101\">Coming Soon</h3><h3 data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:101\"> </h3><h3 data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:101\">Powerful Reporting &amp; Insights to Fuel Your Real Estate Success on PropertyList.es</h3><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:320\">Our system is diligently gathering data to provide you with the most insightful reports and statistics possible. While building this robust system takes time, it will be well worth the wait. This information will empower you to make data-driven decisions and optimise your listings for maximum success on PropertyList.es.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:31\"><strong>Here&#8217;s what you can expect:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"9:1-14:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:210\"><strong>Gain Valuable Insights:</strong> PropertyList.es will soon offer a comprehensive Reports and Statistics section, providing you with a wealth of information about your listings&#8217; performance and the broader market.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:149\"><strong>Track Key Metrics:</strong> Easily monitor listing views, enquiries, and lead conversions to understand what&#8217;s attracting potential buyers and renters.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:211\"><strong>Identify Opportunities:</strong> Gain insights into which aspects of your listings are performing well and where there&#8217;s room for improvement. Leverage this knowledge to optimise your approach and close more deals.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"12:1-12:252\"><strong>Local Market Trends:</strong> Go beyond your individual listings and gain access to valuable data about local sales trends. See what property types are in high demand, average closing times, and other market insights crucial for informed decision-making.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"13:1-14:0\"><strong>Data-Driven Decisions:</strong> Leverage real estate data to optimise your listings, target the right audience, and ultimately close more deals.</li></ul><p data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:249\"><strong><a href=\"https://PropertyList.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a> is committed to providing you with the tools and resources you need to thrive in the competitive real estate market. Stay tuned for the launch of our Reports and Statistics section, and get ready to unlock a new level of success!</strong></p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/reports-and-statistics/accessing-property-market-data/": {
      "body": "<h3 data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:188\">COMING SOON</h3><p> </p><p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:188\"><strong>Knowledge is power, especially in the dynamic world of real estate.</strong> PropertyList.es empowers you with access to valuable property market data, giving you a strategic edge.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:27\">Here&#8217;s what you can expect:</p><ul data-sourcepos=\"7:1-11:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:263\"><strong>Market Trends:</strong> Stay informed about current trends in property prices, sales volume, and market activity across different regions and property types. This knowledge allows you to set realistic expectations for your clients and make informed recommendations.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:256\"><strong>Comparative Analysis:</strong> Gain insights into comparable properties in your client&#8217;s area of interest. Analyse factors like size, location, amenities, and recent sales to determine a property&#8217;s fair market value and position your listings competitively.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:198\"><strong>Data-Driven Decisions:</strong> Leverage market data to inform your strategies. Identify high-demand areas, understand buyer preferences, and tailor your marketing efforts to reach the right audience.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"10:1-11:0\"><strong>Competitive Landscape:</strong> Get a clear picture of your competition by analysing listing activity and market share for other agencies. This knowledge can help you refine your approach and stand out in the market.</li></ul><p data-sourcepos=\"12:1-12:200\">By accessing and utilising property market data on PropertyList.es, you can become a true market expert, fostering trust with your clients and achieving greater success in your real estate endeavours.</p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/reports-and-statistics/identifying-market-trends/": {
      "body": "<h3 data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:228\">COMING SOON</h3><p> </p><p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:228\">The real estate market is constantly evolving, and staying ahead of the curve is crucial for success. PropertyList.es MLS equips you with the tools to identify market trends, giving you a vital edge in today&#8217;s dynamic landscape.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:44\">Here&#8217;s how PropertyList.es MLS empowers you:</p><ul data-sourcepos=\"7:1-11:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:198\"><strong>Real-Time Insights:</strong> Access up-to-date market data, including property listings, sales figures, and market activity. This allows you to spot emerging trends as they happen, not after the fact.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:232\"><strong>Granular Analysis:</strong> Drill down and analyze data for specific regions, property types, and price ranges. This granular approach helps you understand micro-trends within the broader market and tailor your strategies accordingly.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:241\"><strong>Predictive Power:</strong> By identifying historical patterns and current shifts, you can anticipate future trends. This foresight allows you to advise clients effectively, prepare for market fluctuations, and make informed business decisions.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"10:1-11:0\"><strong>Data-Driven Decisions:</strong> Don&#8217;t rely on gut instinct alone. Leverage market trend data to inform your recommendations, pricing strategies, and marketing efforts. Back your expertise with data to build trust with clients and achieve optimal results.</li></ul><p data-sourcepos=\"12:1-12:217\"><a href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es MLS &amp; CRM</a> goes beyond simply listing properties. It empowers you to become a market trend interpreter, positioning yourself as a valuable resource for your clients and a leader in the real estate industry.</p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/requests/": {
      "body": "<h3>&#8211; Coming Soon</h3>\n<p>Welcome to ReQuests, an integral part of our comprehensive MLS platform. Here, agents can efficiently search and filter client requests, whether originating from other estate agents or direct clients from the Public Portal. </p>\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Search and Filter</strong>: Quickly navigate through a vast array of client demands to find those matching your listings.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Integration with MLS</strong>: As part of the MLS platform, ReQuests enhances your workflow by offering a seamless, unified experience.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Structure:</h3>\n<p>LeadBoard is divided into two main sections:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Agent ReQuests</strong>: Tailored for estate agents to access requests from other agents.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Client ReQuests</strong>: Designed for direct client requests, allowing agents to find and connect with potential clients from the Propertylist.es Public Portal.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>See more details in the sections following.</strong></p>\n<p>Dive into ReQuests to maximise your real estate opportunities and streamline your client interactions.</p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/sales-pipeline-tracking/": {
      "body": "<div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\" dir=\"ltr\"><h3 data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:76\">Pipeline Tracking: Your Roadmap to Real Estate Success on <a href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a></h3><p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:279\">Ever feel like you&#8217;re juggling leads without a clear picture of where each one stands in the process? Pipeline tracking on PropertyList.es offers a powerful solution, giving you a real-time view of your sales funnel through a visual chart and empowering you to close more deals.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:30\"><strong>What is Pipeline Tracking?</strong></p><p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:237\">Imagine a roadmap for your potential clients – that&#8217;s what pipeline tracking does. It allows you to visualise the stages each lead progresses through, from initial contact to successful completion. </p><p data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:24\"><strong>Benefits for Agents:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"23:1-27:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"23:1-23:289\"><strong>Identify Bottlenecks:</strong> Easily see if leads are getting stuck at a particular stage, like &#8220;Viewed&#8221; but not moving to &#8220;Reserved&#8221;. This helps you identify areas where your process needs improvement. Perhaps follow-up communication after viewings could be enhanced.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"24:1-24:181\"><strong>Prioritise Leads:</strong> Focus your efforts on leads with the highest closing potential. Allocate time and resources accordingly.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"25:1-25:219\"><strong>Improved Communication:</strong> Stay informed about each lead&#8217;s progress and ensure timely follow-up at each stage. </li><li data-sourcepos=\"25:1-25:219\"><strong style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">Accurate Forecasting:</strong><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\"> Gain insights into your projected sales based on the composition of your pipeline. </span></li></ul><p><strong style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">Benefits for Administrators:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"30:1-34:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"30:1-30:188\"><strong>Team Overview:</strong> Monitor the overall health of the company&#8217;s sales pipeline. See how different agents are performing and identify areas for potential coaching or resource allocation.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"31:1-31:274\"><strong>Filter &amp; Analyse:</strong> Drill down into specific team members, property types (apartments, houses, etc.), or stages of the pipeline to gain deeper insights. For instance, analyse which property types convert most frequently from &#8220;Viewed&#8221; to &#8220;Reserved&#8221;.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"32:1-32:319\"><strong>Data-Driven Decisions:</strong> Use pipeline data to make strategic decisions regarding marketing efforts, resource allocation, and overall sales strategy.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"32:1-32:319\"><strong style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">Advanced Team Management:</strong><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\"> Assign staff members to specific leads or contacts within the pipeline. This allows for efficient task delegation and ensures leads are nurtured by the most relevant team member based on their expertise or location.</span></li></ul><p data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:59\"><strong>PropertyList.es takes pipeline tracking a step further:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"37:1-40:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"37:1-37:247\"><strong>Lead Scoring (</strong><b>Coming Soon): </b>The platform incorporates lead scoring to prioritise leads based on their likelihood of converting. Leads who demonstrate strong interest through detailed enquiries or multiple viewing requests might be assigned a higher score.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"38:1-38:197\"><strong>Customisable Stages (Coming Soon):</strong> Adapt the sales stages to your specific process for a more tailored experience. You might want to add a stage for following up after an offer is submitted.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"39:1-40:0\"><strong>Reporting &amp; Insights (Coming Soon):</strong> Generate reports that provide valuable data and insights into your sales performance. Track trends over time, compare agent performance, and identify areas for improvement.</li></ul><div><p><strong>Stop juggling leads and take control of your sales pipeline today! Sign up for free on <a href=\"https://PropertyList.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a> and experience the power of a visual sales roadmap. Close more deals, gain valuable insights, and streamline your real estate business.</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://PropertyList.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sign up today!</a></p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/searching-for-properties/": {
      "body": "<p>Learn how to search and share properties, create property alerts and save properties to a contact.</p>\n<p>Check out our <strong>Smart Keyword Search,</strong> where you can find anything specific from &#8220;marbel couter top&#8221; to &#8220;double glazed windows&#8221; and much more!</p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/security/": {
      "body": "<ul style=\"letter-spacing: 0.15px;\"><li><strong>Cloudflare Protection:</strong> We leverage Cloudflare’s advanced security solutions to shield our network from malicious attacks and ensure seamless, secure access to our services.</li><li><strong>Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA):</strong> Adding an extra layer of security, MFA helps protect your account by requiring multiple forms of verification before granting access.</li><li><strong>Intrusion Detection and Firewalls:</strong> Our networks are designed with robust intrusion detection systems and firewalls to monitor and block unauthorised access attempts.</li><li><strong>Regular Penetration Testing:</strong> We conduct frequent penetration tests to identify and address potential vulnerabilities, ensuring our defences are always up to date.</li><li><strong>24/7 Monitoring:</strong> Our security team continuously monitors our systems to detect and respond to any suspicious activity in real-time.</li></ul><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">With these comprehensive security measures in place, you can trust that your data on PropertyList.es is protected against hackers and other threats. Your privacy and security are our top priorities, and we are committed to maintaining a safe and secure environment for all our users.</p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">Stay connected and stay secure with PropertyList.es.</p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/technical-documentation/": {
      "body": "<p>At PropertyList.es, we provide comprehensive technical documentation to assist you with various tasks, including XML export. Our documentation is designed to be clear, detailed, and user-friendly, ensuring you have all the information you need at your fingertips. If you need further assistance, please <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/mls-support/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">raise a ticket with support</a>.</p>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/tracking-listing-exposure/": {
      "body": "<p>Track views, inquiries, and engagement to understand how your listing performs.    We are constantly improving our software and technology to provide you with the best options possible. </p><ul><li>more coming soon</li></ul><h3> </h3>"
    },
    "/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/verified-agency/": {
      "body": "<p><strong>Benefits of Becoming a Verified Agency:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Professional Recognition:</strong> The &#8220;Verified Check Mark&#8221; indicates that your agency is legitimate and recognised within the professional community.</li><li><strong style=\"color: var(--p_color);\">Check Mark on Properties:</strong><span style=\"color: var(--p_color);\"> Your properties will also display a check mark on the property page, indicating their verified status.</span></li><li><strong>Duplicate Properties: </strong>Your <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/duplicate-properties/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">duplicate listings</a> will be prioritised over a non Verified Agency&#8217;s listing.</li><li><strong>Verification Bonus:</strong> Upon verification, agencies will be awarded 20 Credits (equivalent to €20) for use on the platform!</li></ol><p><strong>Steps to Become Verified:</strong></p><ol><li>Add your company SL number</li><li>Provide your website</li><li>Link your social media account</li><li>Connect your Google Business account.</li></ol><p><strong>Each &#8220;Verified Check Mark&#8221; will link to your Google Reviews.</strong></p><p>By becoming a verified agency on PropertyList, you enhance your professional presence, connect with like-minded professionals, and build a reputation of trust and reliability within the industry.</p>"
    },
